{
  "study": "how much revenue reaction the month-end decision convention discards",
  "status": "EXPLORATORY descriptive statistic — no hypothesis tested, no new trials",
  "question": "H11/H12/H16 set the decision date at the month end of the disclosure month, but the statutory filing deadline is the 10th. How much excess return happens in the discarded window?",
  "convention_in_use": {
